From: TheEggmanEmpire <backstage@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] backstage-home-buttons

Connect Home's start, stop and setup controls to the desktop lifecycle. Preserve player ownership, display selection and the current setup guidance.
